                                "sense_id": "1c562385-5b18-3dba-ba9d-c41811403ff5",
                                "text": "Under the intensely white mural of the church, crowned by a cinnabaric cornice, and enlivened by the color-spot of the medallion, are congregated figures of darkly painted monks from whom are reflected the cinnabaric and the bright-green colors of the angelic figures."
